    <p class="bio">Peter Müller is a senior UX designer at Google, working on Chrome DevTools. He helps to bring new features like code completion, better CSS debugging and AI assistance to millions of web developers. Peter is also studying for a degree in computer science, so he can build what he designs every day.</p>
